  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre TF-40 290 16M V3 is the lightest and fastest model in the TF-40 family. Featuring a 98 sq.in head, 290 g unstrung weight and a 16x19 string pattern, it delivers excellent maneuverability while maintaining the TF-40 signature precision. RS Sharp Section optimizes frame flex for directional control, the polyurethane foam-filled frame improves feel and comfort, and Extense BG grommets increase string movement and responsiveness on off-center shots.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TF-40 290 16M V3 是 TF-40 系列中最轻量、最容易挥动的一款控制型球拍。采用98平方英寸拍面、290克空拍重量及16×19线床，在保持 TF-40 系列精准控制手感的同时，大幅提升拍头加速能力。RS Sharp Section 优化击球时拍框弯曲，提升线路控制；整支拍框内部填充聚氨酯泡沫，提高舒适性与扎实击球感；Extense BG 线孔增强球线活动空间，使非甜区击球依然保持良好的反馈与旋转能力。"
  },

